/**
 * single-file demo server: serves shop UI + Xsolla webhook + return page
 *
 * Usage:
 * 1) npm init -y
 * 2) npm i express node-fetch
 * 3) node server.js
 *
 * Env:
 * - PORT (default 3000)
 * - XSOLLA_SECRET (optional) - for HMAC verification of webhook (hex)
 * - GAME_BACKEND_URL (optional) - POST grant payload { uid, productId, transactionId }
 * - GAME_BACKEND_KEY (optional) - Bearer token for game backend
 *
 * Test flow with ngrok:
 * - ngrok http 3000
 * - set Xsolla merchant webhook URL to https://<ngrok-id>.ngrok.io/webhook/xsolla
 * - set developer_return_url in client mapping to https://<ngrok-id>.ngrok.io/xsolla/return
 */

